'''Boils''' start as small red spheres that slowly grow to full size. When at their full size, they can spurt out a cluster of blood shots at Isaac, similar to one of {{E|Monstro}}'s attacks. Boils decrease in size when hit, but will regenerate to their full size until fully destroyed.

