'''Sacks''' don't shoot projectiles; instead, they periodically spawn a {{E|Spider}} when fully swollen. Therefore, damaging them will prevent them from spawning Spiders, making them easy to kill. They also regenerate much slower than Boils or Guts. They can commonly be found on the early floors.

=== Notes ===
* Up to six spiders can be active at once.
* {{dlc+|r}} They can spawn in unique {{R|Curse Room}} layouts if Isaac has {{I|Voodoo Head}}.{{dlc-}}
{{clear}}

