=== Gush ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = a+
 | name        = Gush
 | id          = 309
 | base hp     = 20
 | environment = {{floor|Dank Depths}}
 | behavior    = Stationary, harmless enemy that continually creates slowing [[black creep]].
}}

'''Gushes''' are stationary, being unable to do any form of damage. Instead, they continuously create slowing [[black creep]] around them that slowly expands infinitely in radius and can cover the entire room if left alive for long enough. Unlike other Boil variants, they do not shrink or regenerate.

Although the Black Creep is relatively harmless on its own, {{E|Tar Boy}}s can use their special attack if Isaac is standing on the creep.

{{clear}}

=== Pustule ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Pustule
 | id          = 861
 | base hp     = 19
 | environment = {{floor|Corpse}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
 | behavior    = Slowly increases in size over time, spawning {{E|Small Maggot}}s and damaging [[red creep]] depending on its size upon death. If it grows to full size, it transforms into a {{E|Bloodfly}}.
}}

'''Pustules''' are stationary enemies that appear to grow out of the ground, unlike Boils they do not shrink when damaged and instead continuously swell in size. When destroyed at the smallest stages, they explode into a tiny puddle of [[red creep]] and don't spawn anything. When destroyed at the last 2 stages of swelling they spawn a {{E|Small Maggot}} and a small pool of Red Creep, and if not destroyed, they will burst into a {{E|Bloodfly}} and a slightly larger puddle of Red Creep.

