== Notes ==
* {{dlc|na+}} While regular Boils can be touched without taking damage, [[champion]] forms ''do'' inflict one heart of damage on touch (like all champions).
* [[Champion]] Boils grow significantly slower but take more hits to deflate. The exception to this is gray champions, which grow faster and take fewer hits to deflate.

== Trivia ==
* Gushes were added in [[Booster Pack #4]], after the initial release of the DLC.
* {{dlc|r}} A [[wikipedia:Skin condition#Pustule|pustule]] is the scientific name for a pimple.
* {{dlc|r}} Pustules in ''Antibirth'' would burst into Small Maggots and puddles of Green Creep as opposed to the Bloodfly and Red Creep in ''Repentance''.

